--- HOW TO READ -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  hit  = the full-vocab argmax became the counterpart form ("used" -> " use"). Strict success.
  flip = the pair ordering reversed only. This can be true while the model emits NEITHER
         form, so a high flip beside a low hit means the position was destroyed, not steered.
  alpha = multiples of each space's OWN mean-difference norm, so alpha=1 moves a point by
         exactly the past->base gap in that space. That is what makes the columns comparable.

